---
// ProblemSection.astro
---

<section class="section-wrapper problem-section" id="comparison">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="problem-content-block">
      <div class="section-eyebrow">The Philosophy</div>
      <h2 class="section-title">
        Your files shouldn't feel harder <br class="br-desktop" />to manage than they are.
      </h2>
      <p class="section-subtitle">
        You already know what you want to organize. But Finder forces you through open windows, nested folders, drag-and-drop mistakes, and lost desktop context.
      </p>

      <div class="philosophy-statement-card">
        <div class="statement-accent-bar"></div>
        <div class="statement-body">
          <p class="statement-quote">
            “You should spend your time working with your files — not fighting your file manager.”
          </p>
          <div class="statement-steps">
            <span class="step-chip">Locate Folder</span>
            <span class="step-arrow">&rarr;</span>
            <span class="step-chip">Select Items</span>
            <span class="step-arrow">&rarr;</span>
            <span class="step-chip">Move with Direct Action</span>
            <span class="step-arrow">&rarr;</span>
            <span class="step-chip step-done">Done.</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Comparative Flow Visualization -->
    <div class="friction-grid">
      <!-- The Old Friction -->
      <div class="friction-card before">
        <div class="card-status-badge before-badge">Finder Sprawl</div>
        <h3 class="card-title">Scattered windows and lost focus</h3>
        <ul class="friction-list">
          <li>
            <svg class="icon-friction" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/>
              <line x1="15" y1="9" x2="9" y2="15"/>
              <line x1="9" y1="9" x2="15" y2="15"/>
            </svg>
            <span>5 to 8 overlapping Finder windows cluttering your display</span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <svg class="icon-friction" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/>
              <line x1="15" y1="9" x2="9" y2="15"/>
              <line x1="9" y1="9" x2="15" y2="15"/>
            </svg>
            <span>Precarious drag-and-drop across multiple monitors and spaces</span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <svg class="icon-friction" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/>
              <line x1="15" y1="9" x2="9" y2="15"/>
              <line x1="9" y1="9" x2="15" y2="15"/>
            </svg>
            <span>Accidentally dropping critical files into wrong adjacent folders</span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <svg class="icon-friction" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
              <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/>
              <line x1="15" y1="9" x2="9" y2="15"/>
              <line x1="9" y1="9" x2="15" y2="15"/>
            </svg>
            <span>Repetitive deep folder traversal just to find one project archive</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- The Maggo Way -->
      <div class="friction-card after">
        <div class="card-status-badge after-badge">Maggo Calm</div>
        <h3 class="card-title">One disciplined, predictable workspace</h3>
        <ul class="friction-list">
          <li>
            <svg class="icon-flow" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5">
              <polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/>
            </svg>
            <span>Single window with native folder tabs (⌘T)</span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <svg class="icon-flow" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5">
              <polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/>
            </svg>
            <span>Instant Move To (⌘⇧M) &amp; Copy To without dragging</span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <svg class="icon-flow" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5">
              <polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/>
            </svg>
            <span>Dual split view (⌘⇧S) to see source and destination side by side</span>
          </li>
          <li>
            <svg class="icon-flow" width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5">
              <polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/>
            </svg>
            <span>Clickable breadcrumb path bar for 1-click parent directory jumps</span>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .problem-section {
    background-color: var(--color-bg-subtle);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border-light);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border-light);
  }

  .problem-content-block {
    max-width: 820px;
    margin: 0 auto 4rem auto;
    text-align: center;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .br-desktop {
    display: none;
  }

  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .br-desktop {
      display: inline;
    }
  }

  .philosophy-statement-card {
    background: #FFFFFF;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    padding: 2.25rem 2.5rem;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
    display: flex;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    text-align: left;
    max-width: 740px;
    width: 100%;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .statement-accent-bar {
    width: 4px;
    background: var(--color-accent);
    border-radius: 4px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .statement-body {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1rem;
    flex: 1;
  }

  .statement-quote {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-text-main);
    line-height: 1.5;
    letter-spacing: -0.015em;
  }

  .statement-steps {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.6rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .step-chip {
    background: #F8FAFC;
    border: 1px solid #E2E8F0;
    padding: 0.25rem 0.75rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-pill);
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-text-body);
  }

  .step-chip.step-done {
    background: #ECFDF5;
    border-color: #A7F3D0;
    color: #065F46;
  }

  .step-arrow {
    color: #94A3B8;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
  }

  /* Friction vs Flow Cards */
  .friction-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 2rem;
    max-width: 980px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .friction-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    }
  }

  .friction-card {
    background: #FFFFFF;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    padding: 2.5rem 2.25rem;
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    transition: transform 0.2s var(--ease-apple), box-shadow 0.2s var(--ease-apple);
  }

  .friction-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
  }

  .friction-card.after {
    border-color: rgba(136, 84, 208, 0.35);
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, #FFFFFF 0%, rgba(136, 84, 208, 0.04) 100%);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-md);
  }

  .card-status-badge {
    display: inline-block;
    align-self: flex-start;
    padding: 0.2rem 0.7rem;
    border-radius: var(--radius-pill);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }

  .before-badge {
    background: #FEF2F2;
    color: #991B1B;
    border: 1px solid #FECACA;
  }

  .after-badge {
    background: rgba(136, 84, 208, 0.1);
    color: var(--color-accent);
    border: 1px solid rgba(136, 84, 208, 0.25);
  }

  .card-title {
    font-size: 1.35rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: -0.025em;
    color: var(--color-text-main);
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .friction-list {
    list-style: none;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.15rem;
  }

  .friction-list li {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 0.85rem;
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: var(--color-text-body);
  }

  .icon-friction {
    color: #EF4444;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    margin-top: 0.15rem;
  }

  .icon-flow {
    color: var(--color-accent);
    flex-shrink: 0;
    margin-top: 0.15rem;
  }
</style>
